---
// api-docs-read: static offer block — no external API/protocol surface, only mailto and a booking link.
// The offer on indexed AI-work pages (26 Nov 2026): an easy intro, a free diagnostic of how to approach this work
// with AI, which leads to an AI consulting engagement. data-cta="consulting" is what tests/site.test.mjs looks for.
const { job = 'this work', heading = '', ask = '', spot = '' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="article-cta" id="diagnostic" data-cta="consulting" data-diag={spot || undefined}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label">Free diagnostic</div>
    <h2>{heading || `Not sure how to approach ${job}? Get a free diagnostic`}</h2>
    <p>{ask || 'Tell us the work and what it costs you today. In 30 minutes you get our read on how to approach it with AI.'}</p>
    <ul class="cta-steps">
      <li><strong>Buy or build:</strong> whether a product already does this well enough, or it is worth building.</li>
      <li><strong>What to benchmark:</strong> the two or three tools and models worth testing on your own files.</li>
      <li><strong>Rules:</strong> the regulations that shape the build, and what they mean for you.</li>
      <li><strong>Rough cost:</strong> what it would take to run, and to get built.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn-gold" href="https://calendly.com/zavient/call">Book a free 30-minute diagnostic &rarr;</a></p>
    <p class="cta-secondary">Or email <a href="mailto:hello@zavient.com">hello@zavient.com</a> with two sentences on the work. Not ready to talk? Take the <a href="/ai-readiness-assessment.html">AI readiness check</a> first. See <a href="/about.html#engagements">how paid work runs and what it costs</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
